      "user": "SpencerFs",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31340590-1786905897.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Pretty fun game, I've only spent a few hours on it so far, if you like a good challenging platformer you should play this game. It's the right balance in between too hard and baby mode, nice indie game and for only $1.50 right now."
    },
    {
      "game": "Dragon's Dogma 2",
